      {
        "id": 3910284690,
        "node_id": "PR_kwDOJlIj0c7pEjWS",
        "number": 1511,
        "state": "closed",
        "title": "fix: extract getBackoffDelay to client-safe util to fix Vercel deploy (#32)",
        "body": "## Summary\n- Root cause: `AgentSessionCard` (client component) imported `getBackoffDelay` from `agent-sse-manager`, which transitively imports `postgres` → Node.js built-ins (`net`, `tls`, `crypto`, `stream`, `perf_hooks`) leaked into client bundle\n- Fix: extract `getBackoffDelay` into `lib/agent-sse-utils.ts` (pure TS, zero server deps)\n- `AgentSessionCard` now imports from `agent-sse-utils`\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Vercel deploy should build successfully\n- [ ] `curl https://neptune-chat-ashy.vercel.app/api/diagnostics` returns fresh response\n- [ ] AgentSessionCard still renders with SSE reconnection backoff\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/vercel/chatbot/pull/1511",
        "created_at": "2026-06-22T08:18:50Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-22T08:19:08Z",
        "closed_at": "2026-06-22T08:18:58Z",
        "merged_at": null,
        "merge_commit_sha": "c00a513c6c19b584812362a3035ace01ca22f812",
        "draft": false,
        "user": {
          "id": 252243939,
          "node_id": "U_kgDODwjv4w",
          "login": "abhiswami2121",
          "type": "User",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/abhiswami2121"
        },
        "head": {
          "sha": "fda37fc1fcb478199d8a2b38f5623a90b0186bd6",
          "ref": "fix/client-bundle-postgres-leak"
        },
        "base": {
          "sha": "2becdb4a56e7683ae08aef927cec1c6c52dfad5e",
          "ref": "main"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3523716659,
        "node_id": "PR_kwDOJlIj0c7SB6Yz",
        "number": 1483,
        "state": "closed",
        "title": "fix(blob): switch to private access with auth-gated delivery route",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nUser-uploaded images are auth-gated content that should not be publicly accessible. This switches from public to private blob storage and adds a delivery route that checks the user's session before serving files.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Upload: `access: \"public\"` -> `access: \"private\"`, returns `/api/files/serve?pathname=...` instead of raw blob URL\n- New `/api/files/serve` route: checks auth, streams private blob with ETag caching support\n- Removed `*.public.blob.vercel-storage.com` from `next.config.ts` image patterns\n- `vercel-template.json`: forces private access in 1-click deploy flow\n\n**No client changes needed** — the upload response interface (`{ url, pathname, contentType }`) is preserved, and `next/image` works with same-origin URLs without `remotePatterns`.\n\n**Test deploy:** https://vercel.com/new/clone?repository-url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvercel%2Fchatbot%2Ftree%2Fblob-private-access\n\n## Context\n\nAligns with the private-by-default direction for Vercel Blob (see vercel/front#65379, vercel/vercel#15375). The CLI now defaults to private-first prompts and requires explicit `--access` flags.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/vercel/chatbot/pull/1483",
        "created_at": "2026-04-13T15:33:00Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-05-18T14:29:08Z",
        "closed_at": "2026-05-18T14:29:08Z",
